{"title": "Toggle Non-Lethal Attacks", "pageid": 27943, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks", "categories": ["Passive features", "Toggleable passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks.webp/300px-Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks.webp, /w/images/d/d9/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks.webp/300px-Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Toggle Non-Lethal Attacks</b> is a common toggleable passive feature that allows users to knock targets out instead of killing them. Toggling on/off will apply to the entire party of playable characters, but not to summons such as familiars.\n</p><p>While this passive is turned on, when an <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Unarmed Strike\">Unarmed Strike</a> or melee weapon attack reduces a creatures <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a> to zero or one, it becomes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Knocked Out\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\">Knocked Out</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Temporary)_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Temporary) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Knocked Out (Temporary)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Temporary)_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Temporary) (Condition)\">Knocked Out (Temporary)</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Knock someone <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unconscious\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\">Unconscious</a> instead of killing them. \n</p><p>Must be unarmed or using a melee weapon. Does not work <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Constructs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Constructs\">constructs</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Oozes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oozes\">oozes</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Non-Lethal_Damage\"> Condition: Non-Lethal Damage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Non-Lethal_Damage_(Condition)\" title=\"Non-Lethal Damage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Non-Lethal Damage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Non-Lethal_Damage_(Condition)\" title=\"Non-Lethal Damage (Condition)\">Non-Lethal Damage</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Non-lethal damage does not kill creatures if it reduces their hit points to 0, it just leaves them unconscious.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Amphol\" title=\"Amphol\">Amphol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Augur_Harxkellan\" title=\"Augur Harxkellan\">Augur Harxkellan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Drybeldiyx\" title=\"Drybeldiyx\">Drybeldiyx</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fallen_Bhaalspawn\" title=\"Fallen Bhaalspawn\">Fallen Bhaalspawn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gaheid_Slickjaw\" title=\"Gaheid Slickjaw\">Gaheid Slickjaw</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Klarrvox\" title=\"Klarrvox\">Klarrvox</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pritt_Yellowbreath\" title=\"Pritt Yellowbreath\">Pritt Yellowbreath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pythonicus\" title=\"Pythonicus\">Pythonicus</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Surixana\" title=\"Surixana\">Surixana</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thomas_C._Quirkilious\" title=\"Thomas C. Quirkilious\">Thomas C. Quirkilious</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zgorrellik\" title=\"Zgorrellik\">Zgorrellik</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>While in combat with a creature, if they have the condition <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Temporarily_Hostile_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporarily Hostile (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Temporarily Hostile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Temporarily_Hostile_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporarily Hostile (Condition)\">Temporarily Hostile</a>, they become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Temporary)_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Temporary) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Knocked Out (Temporary)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Temporary)_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Temporary) (Condition)\">Knocked Out (Temporary)</a>; after a long rest they regain consciousness. If the creature does not have this condition, it disappears permanently after a long rest, and in some cases may be treated as dead by the game. Healing a knocked-out character does not restore them to consciousness; only a long rest does so.</li>\n<li>It is still possible to loot most things from a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Knocked Out\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\">Knocked Out</a> except tadpoles, heads, etc.</li>\n<li>The feature can be found under the \"Passives\" section of the hotbar (or by expanding the action radial if using a controller). The icon that shows <i>\"Toggle Non-Lethal Attacks\"</i> must be pressed.</li>\n<li>Curiously enough, some non-melee attacks, like Monk's <a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles:_Redirect\" title=\"Deflect Missiles: Redirect\">Deflect Missiles: Redirect</a> are capable of taking benefit from this passive, knocking targets out instead of killing them.</li>\n<li>Most forms of damage caused by a melee attack still knock the creature out instead of killing it (<a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\">Smite</a>, thunder damage from <a href=\"/wiki/Cacophony\" title=\"Cacophony\">Cacophony</a>, etc); but all spell damage kills it.</li>\n<li>Damage boosts that are directly added to the melee weapon or unarmed attack damage will knock the entity unconcious but any boosts that add to the damage calculation are not considered non-lethal and will still kill the damaged entity.</li>\n<li>Under most circumstances, the game treats <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Knocked Out\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\">Knocked Out</a> characters as if they are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Dead (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Dead (Condition)\">Dead</a>. However, there are a couple of instances where the game treats knocking out characters as a legitimate outcome.\n<ul><li>Normally, while playing as the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Urge\" title=\"Dark Urge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/25px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/38px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/50px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dark Urge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/25px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Urge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dark Urge\">Dark Urge</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/38px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/50px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alfira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\">Alfira</a> is to be unwittingly murdered upon Long Resting, after she she arrived at the camp. If Alfira is killed or knocked out before, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quil_Grootslang\" title=\"Quil Grootslang\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/25px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/38px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/50px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Quil Grootslang\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/25px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Quil_Grootslang\" title=\"Quil Grootslang\">Quil Grootslang</a> appears in her stead. If Alfira survives until the end of the game, which is only possible by knocking her out before the murder event, she recognizes that the Dark Urge has stayed their hand and is grateful to them for sparing her.</li>\n<li>In both circumstances where <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/38px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/50px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Auntie Ethel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">Auntie Ethel</a> is fought, her Mask servants can be knocked out and after a Long Rest after Ethel is killed, they are shown to be free from her control.</li>\n<li>It is possible to recruit <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/25px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/38px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/50px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minthara\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/25px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a> while siding with the tiefling refugees by knocking her out. This allows her to show up in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> where she can be recruited, while the party can still complete <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Save_the_Refugees\" title=\"Save the Refugees\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Save the Refugees\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Save_the_Refugees\" title=\"Save the Refugees\">Save the Refugees</a>.</li>\n<li>If demanded by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kethk\" title=\"Kethk\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Portrait_Kethk.png/25px-Portrait_Kethk.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Portrait_Kethk.png/38px-Portrait_Kethk.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Portrait_Kethk.png/50px-Portrait_Kethk.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kethk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Portrait_Kethk.png/25px-Portrait_Kethk.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Portrait_Kethk.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kethk\" title=\"Kethk\">Kethk</a> to kill <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Varrl\" title=\"Varrl\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Portrait_Varrl.png/25px-Portrait_Varrl.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Portrait_Varrl.png/38px-Portrait_Varrl.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Portrait_Varrl.png/50px-Portrait_Varrl.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Varrl\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Portrait_Varrl.png/25px-Portrait_Varrl.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Portrait_Varrl.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Varrl\" title=\"Varrl\">Varrl</a>, the player character can spare him by knocking him out, allowing him to be healed after he is dragged out of the classroom.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Marcus_Falgor\" title=\"Marcus Falgor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Portrait_Marcus_Falgor.png/25px-Portrait_Marcus_Falgor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Portrait_Marcus_Falgor.png/38px-Portrait_Marcus_Falgor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Portrait_Marcus_Falgor.png/50px-Portrait_Marcus_Falgor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Marcus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Portrait_Marcus_Falgor.png/25px-Portrait_Marcus_Falgor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Portrait_Marcus_Falgor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Marcus_Falgor\" title=\"Marcus Falgor\">Marcus</a> and his Imps always try to knock out <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Isobel\" title=\"Isobel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Isobel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Isobel\" title=\"Isobel\">Isobel</a> when attempting to capture her in the <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a>. Helping them kidnap her makes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ketheric\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">Ketheric</a> grateful for bringing her back to him, and allows the player character to be rewarded by the Absolute. Should Isobel be killed, however, Ketheric instead is greatly upset, and sends the party to the Absolute as punishment.</li>\n<li>When fought in the sewers, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/25px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/38px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/50px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minsc\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/25px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Minsc</a> must be knocked out in order to recruit him as well as to prevent <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/38px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/50px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jaheira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\">Jaheira</a> from permanently leaving the party.</li>\n<li>As long as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/38px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/50px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Auntie Ethel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">Auntie Ethel</a> has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vanra\" title=\"Vanra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png/25px-Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png/38px-Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png/50px-Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vanra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png/25px-Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vanra\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vanra\">Vanra</a> in her stomach, killing her leads to Vanra's death as well, unless the player character threw a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hag%27s_Bane\" title=\"Hag's Bane\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/GRN_Hag%27s_Bane_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Hag%27s_Bane_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/53/GRN_Hag%27s_Bane_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Hag%27s_Bane_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/53/GRN_Hag%27s_Bane_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-GRN_Hag%27s_Bane_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/GRN_Hag%27s_Bane_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Hag%27s_Bane_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/GRN_Hag%27s_Bane_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hag%27s_Bane\" title=\"Hag's Bane\">Hag's Bane</a> on her beforehand. Alternatively, Vanra can still be freed by knocking Ethel out, which allows the player character to cut her stomach open to release the child from her confinement.</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Korrilla_Hearthflame\" title=\"Korrilla Hearthflame\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Korrilla.png/25px-Portrait_Korrilla.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Korrilla.png/38px-Portrait_Korrilla.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Korrilla.png/50px-Portrait_Korrilla.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Korilla\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Korrilla.png/25px-Portrait_Korrilla.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Portrait_Korrilla.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Korrilla_Hearthflame\" title=\"Korrilla Hearthflame\">Korilla</a> is knocked out rather than killed during the fight against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/38px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/50px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raphael\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hope\" title=\"Hope\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/25px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/38px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/50px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hope\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/25px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hope\" title=\"Hope\">Hope</a> is grateful to the player character for sparing her.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195608\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.132 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.144 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7748/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 71433/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 38508/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 16/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 850/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 989494/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  118.787      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%  118.787      1 -total\n 41.95%   49.832     27 Template:Icon_link\n 40.17%   47.718     27 Template:Icon_text\n 37.53%   44.582      8 Template:Cond\n 32.45%   38.545     62 Template:Trim\n 29.48%   35.021     17 Template:CharLink\n